  tipView2d: 'In both, every belt goes in and out through the right side of the piece, like in the game: a splitter takes input at the back and outputs at the front and sides, a merger the other way around, and never two on the same side. Diagram: compact, fits the screen. Plan: the same drawing to scale, with the foundation grid, the space it takes and markers the size of a Blueprint Designer. Hover or tap a piece, input or output to see only its path.',
