  tipPer2d: 'By level: one step per column of pieces. By piece: one step per splitter or merger, numbered on the drawing (#1, #2…), saying where each one takes from and where it sends to. On the Plan, also which side: left and right are looking along the flow (on the drawing, left is up).',
